<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="DrugImplantThingMakeableBase">
		<defName>DI_GojuiceImplant</defName>
		<label>drug-implant (Gojuice)</label>
		<description>A synthesizer, encoded to produce Go-Juice from nutrients the user eats. The user will need to eat more to sustain themselves as a consequence. The brain requires time to neurologically adapt to the constant presence of the drug, causing complications until the brain has adapted.

Once adapted, the synthesizer produces a lesser dose of Go-Juice, and pumps it into the bloodstream, giving the user some of the effects of Go-Juice at all times without risk of addiction. 

When Go-Juice is ingested by the user, the synthesizer switches to an alternate mode where it directly injects Go-Juice into the brain of the user. As long as the brain remains alive and the high lasts, the user is rendered effectively deathless. 

Grants the user some of the effects of Go-Juice permanently without risk of addiction, and as long as the user is high on Go-Juice and the brain remains intact, renders them deathless.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<RecipeDef>InstallDI_GojuiceImplant</RecipeDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Health/HealthItem</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
			<color>(189,169,118)</color>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
		</statBases>
		<costList>
			<GoJuice>10</GoJuice>
			<DI_BaseImplantPart>1</DI_BaseImplantPart>
		</costList>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
				<li>DrugLab</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisites>
				<li>GoJuiceProduction</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
		</recipeMaker>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>BodyParts</li>
		</thingCategories>
	</ThingDef>
	
